From 3ec5cee1a4bc0e3bb23ef1da0f523a1864ada29c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 10:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] filemanager: take the view from master

The views of the package in openwrt-25.12 are those of December 2025.
openwrt/luci master has two later changes of the author:

- 357f9fb "flexible width, dark mode, refinements": automatic width
  and height of the file list and the editors, colors that follow the
  light or dark mode of the theme, styles limited to the file manager
  so they do not change other elements of the page;
- 177cf48 "correctness fixes": the settings form showed the column
  widths without names and saved them wrong.

The four files are taken from master as they are, so the next patches
of this folder apply to 25.12 and to master alike. On master this patch
is found in the sources and skipped.
